        "## Model and training helpers\n",
        "The architecture, preprocessing, metric accumulator, accuracy calculation, Adam, cross-entropy loss, and training-loop structure come from Module 5.3. New code controls variations and saves/restores experiments. PyTorch default biases are retained, matching the original initialization approach.\n"
